<title>USA: Storage Technology to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Storage Technology to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Colo. 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Storage Technology Corp said its board of directors authorized the repurchase of up to 4.5 million outstanding shares of the company's common stock through a privately negotiated stock repurchase agreement.</p>
<p>The repurchased shares will be retired, Storage Technology said on Thursday. A purchase price was not disclosed, and the purchases will take place over an undisclosed period of time.</p>
<p>The names of the holders were not disclosed.</p>
<p>There were approximately 61.2 million shares of Storage Technology common stock outstanding at August 2, 1996.</p>
</text>
